---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Architecture Overview - Sthenos">
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Sthenos</a>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/drill">Drill</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="section" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1446776811953-b23d57bd21aa?w=1920&q=80');">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">Architecture Overview</p>
      <h1>7-Layer Defense AI Platform</h1>
      <p>The complete architecture spans seven distinct layers, from raw inputs to strategic AI simulation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="layer-list">
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L1</span>
        <span>Raw Inputs (Caldera / Sensors / IoT / Edge)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L2</span>
        <span>Data Normalization (USD / JSON / Streams)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item core">
        <span class="layer-num">L3</span>
        <span>Semantic Enrichment Layer — Core MVP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L4</span>
        <span>Behavioral & Tactical Modeling</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L5</span>
        <span>Synthetic Data Generation Engine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L6</span>
        <span>Decision Support & Scenario Evaluation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-item">
        <span class="layer-num">L7</span>
        <span>Strategic AI / Multi-agent Simulation</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="module-section" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <h2>Component Modules</h2>
      <div class="module-grid">
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #6366f1;">Core</span>
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #10b981;">Enrichment</span>
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #f59e0b;">Ingestion</span>
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #ef4444;">IO</span>
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #8b5cf6;">Pipeline</span>
        <span class="module-tag" style="border-color: #ec4899;">Roles</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="differentiators" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <h2>Key Differentiators</h2>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Terrain-aware reasoning (canonical world frame)</li>
        <li>Dual-path inference (static + streaming)</li>
        <li>Causal evaluation layer (D-effector)</li>
        <li>Air-gap operable (no external network calls)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  nav a {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.17px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-section {
    background: var(--space-black);
    padding: 80px 5%;
  }

  .layer-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .layer-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240, 240, 250, 0.1);
  }

  .layer-item.core {
    border: 1px solid var(--ghost-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
  }

  .layer-num {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 0.5;
    min-width: 24px;
  }

  .layer-item span:last-child {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .module-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .module-tag {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240, 240, 250, 0.1);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .feature-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
</style>